CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786454320
OL,3,CTen people arrested after anti-
OL,4,Cimmigration and counter protests
OL,6,FTen people were arrested following
OL,7,Fanti-immigration and counter protests
OL,8,Fin Bristol city centre on Saturday (8
OL,9,FAugust).
OL,11,FAt its height, there were around 150
OL,12,Fpeople in the protest group and around
OL,13,F300 people with the counter-protest
OL,14,Fgroup, according to Avon and Somerset
OL,15,FPolice.
OL,17,FThe protest group marched from Queen's
OL,18,FSquare at around 10:30am, stopping on
OL,19,FBristol Bridge and outside Bridewell
OL,20,FPolice Station for speeches, before
OL,21,Fending at the Cenotaph.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
