FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786454320
OL,3,CTen people arrested after anti-
OL,4,Cimmigration and counter protests
OL,6,FPolice say there were counter-protests
OL,7,Fat each location.
OL,9,FAmong those arrested from both the
OL,10,Fprotest and counter-protest groups
OL,11,Fthroughout the event, six were
OL,12,Farrested on suspicion of concealing
OL,13,Ftheir identity at a protest - an
OL,14,Foffence covered by new rules that
OL,15,Fallow police to create an area where
OL,16,Fface coverings cannot be worn.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786454320
OL,3,CTen people arrested after anti-
OL,4,Cimmigration and counter protests
OL,6,FThe force said there were also arrests
OL,7,Ffor assaulting an emergency worker,
OL,8,Fintentionally causing harassment,
OL,9,Fassault by beating, acting in a
OL,10,Fdisorderly way, obstructing a public
OL,11,Fhighway and using threatening, abusive
OL,12,For insulting words or behaviour.
OL,14,FAvon and Somerset Police say this was
OL,15,Fthe largest protest in the force's
OL,16,Farea since 2024, with around 300
OL,17,Fpolice officers deployed alongside
OL,18,Fsupport from ten different forces.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
