FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786454320
OL,3,CTen people arrested after anti-
OL,4,Cimmigration and counter protests
OL,6,FSupt Karen Corrigan said: "First and
OL,7,Fforemost, I would like to thank and
OL,8,Frecognise the officers on the ground
OL,9,Fand those behind the scenes who
OL,10,Fenabled today's protest and counter-
OL,11,Fprotest.
OL,13,F"Protest policing is challenging,
OL,14,Fdynamic and ever-changing; one action
OL,15,For word can take a peaceful protest
OL,16,Fcloser to disorder and our officers
OL,17,Fmust quickly and effectively adapt and
OL,18,Fchange.
OL,26,@nD@[OUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786454320
OL,3,CTen people arrested after anti-
OL,4,Cimmigration and counter protests
OL,6,F"Today, we experienced pockets of
OL,7,Fdisorder, especially at the Cenotaph,
OL,8,Fbetween officers and the counter-
OL,9,Fprotesters and then between the two
OL,10,Fgroups.
OL,12,F"It is important when two sides are
OL,13,Fprotesting against each other to
OL,14,Fmaintain a clear boundary between the
OL,15,Ftwo sides to allow each group to
OL,16,Fexpress their views safely and to
OL,17,Fprevent disorder.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786454320
OL,3,CTen people arrested after anti-
OL,4,Cimmigration and counter protests
OL,6,F"When one group tries to push through
OL,7,Fthis clear boundary, officers must
OL,8,Ftake proportionate actions and force
OL,9,Fto maintain the line and prevent
OL,10,Fdisorder.
OL,12,F"Officers utilised the new Section 157
OL,13,Fpowers to order people to remove face
OL,14,Fcoverings or similar. Our Bronze
OL,15,FCommanders were also heard throughout
OL,16,Fthe protest on loud hailers informing
OL,17,Fpeople on the new law and giving them
OL,18,Fthe opportunity to remove them before
OL,19,Ftaking action.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786454320
OL,3,CTen people arrested after anti-
OL,4,Cimmigration and counter protests
OL,6,F"This is a challenging law to carry
OL,7,Fout, especially when faced with such
OL,8,Fhuge numbers of attendees, but the
OL,9,Finitial feedback from my Bronze
OL,10,FCommanders is we were seeing fewer
OL,11,Fpeople with face coverings than we may
OL,12,Fhave in previous protests."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@[O]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/7
